# ever requested. Verify with `gh api repos/SceneWorks/inference/codeowners/errors` after
# editing; an owner needs write access to the repository or its line is silently dropped.
#
# Ownership here is deliberately NOT enforced by ruleset 20481541
# (`require_code_owner_review: false`). This repository is public but has a single
# collaborator, and GitHub forbids approving your own pull request — enforcing code-owner
# review would block every maintainer-authored PR on an approval no account exists to give.
# What this file provides instead is automatic review requests, and GitHub never requests
# review from a PR's own author: maintainer PRs pass untouched while outside fork
# contributions raise a review request. Outside contributions cannot merge regardless, since
# merging and queueing both require write access.
